			"date": "2026-08-13T23:11:56.378Z",
			"content": "<p>The beach ball&#39;s direct ancestor is a monochrome icon on NeXT computers representing a spinning magneto-optical disc, circa 1988. NeXT flopped. Apple acquired it in 1996. The icon survived and eventually got a rainbow Aqua makeover.</p><p><a href=\"https://mastodon.social/tags/NeXT\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>NeXT</span></a> <a href=\"https://mastodon.social/tags/SteveJobs\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>SteveJobs</span></a> <a href=\"https://mastodon.social/tags/DesignHistory\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>DesignHistory</span></a></p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
